825
00:39:12.730 --> 00:39:13.788
Yes. Sorry.

826
00:39:13.998 --> 00:39:15.056
What were you saying?

827
00:39:19.070 --> 00:39:20.128
Okay.

828
00:39:20.204 --> 00:39:21.466
Look, he's a nice guy.

829
00:39:21.539 --> 00:39:22.597
