863
00:40:51.295 --> 00:40:52.557
Fantastic!

864
00:40:53.231 --> 00:40:54.289
Outstanding!

865
00:40:55.299 --> 00:40:56.960
She's going out with someone else.

866
00:40:57.101 --> 00:40:58.568
Now, I'll have to move on!

867
00:40:58.636 --> 00:40:59.694
Super...

868
