Harleen...

2234
02:01:17.148 --> 02:01:18.206
Hey, Harleen!

2235
02:01:34.899 --> 02:01:35.957
Sit there.

2236
02:01:43.841 --> 02:01:47.641
Sometimes laugh and talk to me.

2237
02:01:47.712 --> 02:01:50.875
Don't grind my life
into the ground.

2238
