Love is a heavy burden.

2247
02:02:27.885 --> 02:02:29.682
And a wonderful illness.

2248
02:02:29.754 --> 02:02:32.689
You want to let it go on.

2249
02:02:33.357 --> 02:02:35.257
Love is a long friendship.

2250
02:02:35.326 --> 02:02:36.953
It's issued without a permit.

2251
02:02:37.095 --> 02:02:38.960
We'll be riding high, come on.

2252
02:02:39.030 --> 02:02:42.693
Oh a heart wants another heart.

2253
02:02:42.767 --> 02:02:44.325
Wants to be coloured by love.

2254
02:02:44.402 --> 02:02:45.699
While I live, it will...

2255
02:02:45.770 --> 02:02:47.761
...make me meet God.

2256
02:02:47.839 --> 02:02:49.704
The eyes connecting...

2257
02:02:49.774 --> 02:02:51.332
Dying and disintegrating...

2258
