2264
02:03:43.961 --> 02:03:46.953
These mementos,
I don't want to lose.

2265
02:03:47.031 --> 02:03:49.761
They're precious,
in my breath I want to weave...

2266
02:03:49.834 --> 02:03:51.267
The things you said.

2267
